<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><title>Two menu prototypes</title></head><body style="--ink:#24342c;--ground:#f2f4f3;--surface:white;--accent:#215c49;--muted:#60716a;--sans:Geist,system-ui;font-family:var(--sans)"><main style="max-width:620px;padding:32px 20px;margin:auto"><h1 style="font-size:28px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 10px">Two ways to read the menu.</h1><p style="margin-bottom:28px">Interactive design prototypes. Frozen research fixtures for Thursday, 22 October 2026.</p>{['modern','editorial'].map((direction,i)=><section style="padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #ccd5cf"><h2 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;margin-bottom:8px">{i===0?'1 — Refined modern utility':'2 — Expressive editorial utility'}</h2><p>{i===0?'Pine, white, precise grouping and a compact segmented selector.':'Lemon, aubergine, expressive type and flowing menu text.'}</p><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:16px"><a style="text-decoration:underline;min-height:44px" href={`/${direction}/`}>Open prototype</a><a style="text-decoration:underline;min-height:44px" href={`/${direction}/?scenario=mixed`}>Simulated source failures</a></div></section>)}<p style="font-size:13px;margin-top:20px">Breakfast and Snacks show FC1 + FC2. Lunch and Dinner also show Sindhi Menu 1. No production ingestion or deployment.</p></main></body></html>
